  <p>The Chiller is an equipment feature connected with the Worker and Chiller update.</p>
  <h2>Repairing the Chiller</h2>
  <p>The repair interaction can present Cash or Robux options. Review the values shown in the current game before confirming a repair.</p>
  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
</ContentPage>
